cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Reproducibility release for \"Validation hierarchy and directed transfer reveal limited gut microbiome signature transportability across melanoma immunotherapy cohorts\""
version: 1.0.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22185052"
date-released: 2026-08-30
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Version-locked reproducibility companion for an individual-participant-level secondary analysis of pretreatment gut shotgun metagenomes from melanoma immunotherapy cohorts. The release contains privacy-safe derived inputs, frozen result tables, analysis and reproduction code, software-environment information, and figure-source materials. Project-created derived tables, figures, and documentation are licensed separately under CC BY 4.0; raw public sequencing data are not redistributed or relicensed.
message: "If you use this reproducibility release, please cite this software archive and the associated article."
